<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-FRANCE BEAT FINLAND 2-1 IN EUROPEAN UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-FRANCE BEAT FINLAND 2-1 IN EUROPEAN UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>POITIERS, France 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>France beat Finland 2-1</p>
<p>(halftime 1-1) in a European under-21 championship group three</p>
<p>qualifier on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>France - Bernard Allou 45, 90</p>
<p>Finland - Juha Jussila 20</p>
<p>Attendance: 4,000</p>
<p>    Standings		P  W  D  L   G  A Pts</p>
<p> 1. Norway		   4  3  1  0  15  5  10</p>
<p> 2. France		   4  3  1  0   6  2  10</p>
<p> 3. Switzerland	    4  1  1  2   8 10   4</p>
<p> 4. Finland		  4  1  1  2   3  6   4</p>
<p> 5. Hungary		  4  0  0  4   2 11   0</p>
</text>
